          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bakumuka mu buhika bakafila milambu ya kuosha kudi Nzambi wa Isalele, balume ba ngombe dikumi ne babidi bua Bena Isalele bonso, ne bimpanga makumi tshitema ne bisambombo ne bana ba mikoko makumi muanda mutekete ne muanda mutekete, ne mpumbu ya mbushi dikumi ne ibidi bu milambu ya kubuikila nʼai mibi yabo: bionso ebi biakadi milambu ya kuoshela Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakafila mikenji ya mukelenge mu bianza bia miloho ya mukelenge ne kudi ba-gouverneur bakadi dishiya dia musulu wa Pelata; bobo bakakuatshisha bantu ne mudimu wa nsubu wa Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
